 "description": "A thoughtfully renovated townhouse offering the privacy, flexibility, and outdoor space of single-family living. With a private backyard, an expansive upper terrace, and notably low carrying costs, this home is a compelling alternative to condominium living in one of the borough's most sought-after neighborhoods.\n\nSpanning roughly 1,320 square feet, the residence pairs flexible living spaces with generous natural light. Approximately ten-foot ceilings on the main level and eleven-foot ceilings above create an open, airy feel, while a skylight over the staircase brightens the center of the home.\n\nThe main floor flows from a welcoming front living room to a rear living and dining area anchored by a renovated kitchen, with large glass doors opening directly to the backyard. The layout easily converts to a true three-bedroom configuration. Upstairs, two spacious bedrooms share a central full bath, and the primary opens onto a large private terrace.\n\nAdditional features include an in-unit washer and dryer, ample storage, and a recent renovation ready for immediate occupancy, all moments from local dining, coffee shops, and multiple subway lines.",
